# Device Tree for Infinix Note 30i (X6716)

The Infinix Note 30i (codenamed _"X6716"_) is a mid-range smartphone from Infinix.

It was released in May 2023.

## Device specifications

Basic   | Spec Sheet
-------:|:-------------------------
CPU     | Octa-core (2x2.0 GHz Cortex-A75 & 6x1.8 GHz Cortex-A55)
Chipset | MediaTek Helio G85 (MT6768)
GPU     | Mali-G52 MC2
Memory  | 8 GB RAM
Shipped Android Version | 13 (XOS 13)
Storage | 128 GB / 256 GB
Battery | Li-Po 5000 mAh, non-removable, 33W
Display | 1080 x 2400 pixels, 6.66 inches, AMOLED, 60Hz
Camera  | 64 MP (wide) + 2 MP (depth) + QVGA / 16 MP (front)
